# Entry chrome

These two pages keep their CSS in the page. Do not add a shared stylesheet.

- The link back to the index is `<a class="back">` inside `.back-row`. Do not put a `style` attribute on it. `.back-row` uses `padding: 0.9rem clamp(1rem, 7vw, 5rem) 0` so the link lines up with the headline.
- Define `--line` from `DESIGN.md`. `.card` uses `border: 1px solid var(--line)`.
- At `max-width: 760px`, set `body { background-attachment: scroll; }` so the ruled paper scrolls on a phone.
- A `.tag` is one word or one number (`08`, not `no. 08`).
- On the undo book, `.signoff` uses `flex-wrap: wrap`. The compass uses `minmax(0, 1fr)` and stacks to one column at `760px`, not `640px`.
